<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Fabric Escrow - Real Estate</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #667eea;
        }
        .nav a {
            margin-left: 20px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #333;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .nav a:hover {
            color: #667eea;
        }
        .hero {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 60px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #666;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .cta-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .btn {
            padding: 15px 40px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
        }
        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
        }
        .btn-secondary {
            background: white;
            color: #667eea;
            border: 2px solid #667eea;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            margin-top: 50px;
        }
        .feature-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .feature-card h3 {
            color: #333;
            margin: 20px 0 10px;
        }
        .feature-card p {
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 48px;
        }
        .how-it-works {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 40px;
            margin-top: 50px;
        }
        .how-it-works h2 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .steps {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }
        .step {
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }
        .step-number {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .step h3 {
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .step p {
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 50px;
            color: white;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo">🏠 Fabric Escrow</div>
            <div class="nav">
                <% if (user) { %>
                    <span>Welcome, <%= user.name %></span>
                    <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
                    <a href="/logout">Logout</a>
                <% } else { %>
                    <a href="/login">Login</a>
                    <a href="/register">Register</a>
                <% } %>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero">
            <h1>Secure Real Estate Transactions</h1>
            <p>Buy and sell properties with confidence using blockchain-based escrow.
               Our platform ensures that funds are only released when all conditions are met.</p>
            <div class="cta-buttons">
                <% if (!user) { %>
                    <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started</a>
                    <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn btn-secondary">Learn More</a>
                <% } else { %>
                    <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-primary">Go to Dashboard</a>
                <% } %>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="features">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🔒</div>
                <h3>Secure Escrow</h3>
                <p>Funds are held in smart contracts and only released when all parties approve the transaction.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">📄</div>
                <h3>Title Verification</h3>
                <p>All property titles are verified by authorized parties before listing.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
                <h3>Fast & Transparent</h3>
                <p>All transactions are recorded on the blockchain for complete transparency and traceability.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="how-it-works" id="how-it-works">
            <h2>How It Works</h2>
            <div class="steps">
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">1</div>
                    <h3>Seller Lists Property</h3>
                    <p>Seller adds property details and uploads title deed for verification.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">2</div>
                    <h3>Buyer Makes Offer</h3>
                    <p>Interested buyers submit offers on verified properties.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">3</div>
                    <h3>Holding Deposit</h3>
                    <p>Buyer pays holding deposit to secure the property.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">4</div>
                    <h3>Contract Signing</h3>
                    <p>Both parties review and sign the sales contract.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">5</div>
                    <h3>Final Payment</h3>
                    <p>Buyer deposits final payment into blockchain escrow.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">6</div>
                    <h3>Title Transfer</h3>
                    <p>Both parties approve final title deed and funds are released.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer>
            <p>&copy; 2026 Fabric Escrow - Secure Real Estate Transactions on Blockchain</p>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
